long term assets were as follows:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span><span id="xdx_8BB_zt0adDtCfP86" style="display: none">SCHEDULE OF OTHER LONG TERM ASSETS</span></p>

