<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Rent
expense for operating leases was $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseExpense_pn3d_c20260401__20260630_zuJdfWvDRVoh" title="Operating lease expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" contextRef="From2026-04-012026-06-30" id="Fact000926" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" unitRef="USD">256,000</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseExpense_pn3d_c20260101__20260630_z10jsNeckASg" title="Operating lease expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" contextRef="From2026-01-01to2026-06-30" id="Fact000928" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" unitRef="USD">495,000</ix:nonFraction></span> for the three and six months ended June 30, 2026 and $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseExpense_pn3d_c20250401__20250630_zt9FZ6TS0oJl" title="Operating lease expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" contextRef="From2025-04-012025-06-30" id="Fact000930" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" unitRef="USD">234,000</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseExpense_pn3d_c20250101__20250630_zBghioGr0KGl" title="Operating lease expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-06-30" id="Fact000932" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" unitRef="USD">468,000</ix:nonFraction></span> for
the three and six months ended June 30, 2025.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-01-01to2026-06-30" escape="true" id="Fact000934" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseLiabilityMaturityTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_899_eus-gaap--LesseeOperatingLeaseLiabilityMaturityTableTextBlock_zUqtZYEUKQjk" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Future
minimum lease payments under non-cancelable leases as of June 30, 2026 are as follows:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span><span id="xdx_8B5_zz9wJ5uTqz0d" style="display: none">SCHEDULE OF FUTURE MINIMUM RENTAL PAYMENTS FOR OPERATING LEASES</span></p>

